p Hi #{USERNAME},
if TRIGGER_DATE
  if ACTION_TRANSFER
    p Your account is now set to be transferred to #{BENEFICIARY} on #{DEADLINE}, in #{DAYS_LEFT} days.
  else
    p Your account is now set to be deleted on #{DEADLINE}, in #{DAYS_LEFT} days.
else if TRIGGER_INACTIVITY
  if ACTION_TRANSFER
    p Your account is now set to be transferred to #{BENEFICIARY} after #{INACTIVITY_DAYS} days without use. If nobody uses it until then, it will be transferred on #{DEADLINE}, in #{DAYS_LEFT} days; each use of the account (signing in, an app you connected) moves that date.
  else
    p Your account is now set to be deleted after #{INACTIVITY_DAYS} days without use. If nobody uses it until then, it will be deleted on #{DEADLINE}, in #{DAYS_LEFT} days; each use of the account (signing in, an app you connected) moves that date.
else if ACTION_TRANSFER
  p No transfer of your account is scheduled any more. Your account and your data stay as they are.
else
  p No deletion of your account is scheduled any more. Your account and your data stay as they are.
if SCHEDULED
  if ACTION_TRANSFER
    p #{BENEFICIARY} will then get an email inviting them to accept it and take over the management of your account.
    if FALLBACK_DELETE
      p If #{BENEFICIARY} does not accept it in time, your account and all its data will be deleted, and this cannot be undone.
    else if FALLBACK_KEEP
      p If #{BENEFICIARY} does not accept it in time, your account stays as it is.
    p You will get reminders before that date.
  else
    p All the data of the account will then be erased, and this cannot be undone. You will get reminders before that date.
  if EXPORT_URL
    p
      | To keep a copy of your data, download it before that date:
      |
      a(href=EXPORT_URL target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{EXPORT_URL}
if ACCOUNT_APP_URL
  p
    | To change or cancel this, sign in to your account page and change the auto-deletion setting:
    |
    a(href=ACCOUNT_APP_URL target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{ACCOUNT_APP_URL}
else
  p To change or cancel this, sign in to your account page and change the auto-deletion setting.
p If you did not make this change, sign in, change your password right away and contact the support of your platform.
